<title>ROMANIA: RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES AT 1 PM.</title>
<headline>RADIO ROMANIA AFTERNOON HEADLINES AT 1 PM.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radio Romania news headlines:</p>
<p>* Labour leaders from the cement-making sector protested outside the government headquarters and the State Ownership Fund offices against the government's plans to sell off cement-making plants.</p>
<p>* The cabinet started a meeting to discuss on changes to the law on winding up companies.</p>
<p>-- Bucharest newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
